{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-04T10:02:46.568Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Implementation** (all within task scope):\n- `src/core/web/web-http.ts` — moved `sortKeysDeep`, `serializeWebJson`, `send`, `sendJson`, `sendFailure` out of `web-server.ts`; also hosts the shared `decodeChangeSelector`.\n- `src/core/web/web-actions.ts` — the port types plus `getWebActions`, deriving the document from `resolveChangeFolder`, `readDispatchItems`, and `readNextStep` (unplanned fallback), de-duping commands and skipping `osq show`.\n- `src/core/web/web-write.ts` — per-server token (`randomBytes`), Host/Origin/content-type guard, constant-time token compare (`timingSafeEqual`), JSON body validation, the one-at-a-time `WriteGate`, and `createActionRoutes` for GET/POST on `/api/actions/<id>`.\n- `src/core/web/web-server.ts` — optional `runAction`/`getActions`, correct GET/HEAD/POST routing and 405 `Allow` headers, allowed hosts keyed off the actually-bound port; unchanged behavior without `runAction`.\n- `tests/web-actions.test.ts` — 16 raw-HTTP tests covering every \"Loopback write actions\" scenario, the actions-path 405 scenario, the extra routing checks, before/after tree snapshots for refused writes, and the 500-then-freed runner failure.\n- `decisions/009-loopback-write-actions.md` + `decisions/README.md` index line.\n\n**Verification**: task verify (`node --import tsx ... --test tests/web-actions.test.ts`) passes 16/16, and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`) exits 0 (typechecks, build, full test suite, lint). Result written to `openspec/changes/146-web-write-actions/.run/results/1.md`."}}
